    {
      "id": "p0228-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "With this information in hand, the translator gave Asgore a polite speech pattern for most of his Japanese dialogue, which includes the use of the polite pronoun watashi. For other situations, the translator made sure that Asgore switches to a colder, but still formal speech pattern.",
        "raw": "With this information in hand, the translator gave Asgore a polite speech\npattern for most of his Japanese dialogue, which includes the use of the polite\npronoun watashi. For other situations, the translator made sure that Asgore\nswitches to a colder, but still formal speech pattern.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29525523,
          0.39305714,
          0.89779129,
          0.46053571
