    {
      "id": "p0228-b012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because this animated series was produced for Western audiences, this reference would be missed by most .Japanese players. But rather than force a different reference into this important line, the translator focused on the key information and translated the line literally. Even without the reference, it's still clear in the Japanese script that Asgore and his child were part of a loving family.",
        "raw": "Because this animated series was produced for Western audiences, this\nreference would be missed by most .Japanese players. But rather than force a\ndifferent reference into this important line, the translator focused on the key\ninformation and translated the line literally. Even without the reference, it's still\nclear in the Japanese script that Asgore and his child were part of a loving family.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29805473,
          0.81611429,
          0.91109402,
          0.90148571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2932118,
          0.8154,
          0.91384243,
          0.90255714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          43,
          45,
          47,
          49,
          51
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这部动画面向西方观众制作，多数日本玩家大概不会明白这个典故。不过，译者没有硬往这句重要台词里塞进别的典故，而是抓住关键信息，直接翻译。即使看不出致敬对象，日本玩家仍能清楚感受到 Asgore 和孩子曾有一个充满爱的家。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
